# Checked against the references at random only (examples/asn1/lists.asn1).
#
# asn1c pads after a zero-length BIT STRING (11.9.3.3 NOTE 2 says none, see
# OVERVIEW.md §3): a TaggedList whose element holds an empty VarBits it reads
# out of step from there
deviates asn1c TaggedList
# rasn 0.28, ALIGNED: the alignment faults of alignment.vec (lists'
# elements aligned, a zero length padded)
deviates rasn AltList
deviates rasn Cfg
deviates rasn ColourList
deviates rasn Grid
deviates rasn NibbleList
deviates rasn Packet
deviates rasn TaggedList
#
# Found by byte mutation (X.691 (02/2021)): Blob ::= OCTET
# STRING, its length in the two-octet form of 11.9.3.7, 80 00, for 0, which
# 11.9.3.6 puts in one octet.
reject! Blob 8000  # asn1c, rasn accept ""
